{"ref":"BDB, יַ֫חַת","hw":"יַ֫חַת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יַ֫חַת</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>perhaps for <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחְתֶּה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחֲתֶה</span> <em>he</em> (God) <em>will snatch up</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  grandson of Judah <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.2\">1 Ch 4:2</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, 𝔊 Ιεθ, 𝔊L Ιαωθ.<br><strong>2.</strong>  Levites: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.5\">1 Ch 6:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:28\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.28\">28</a>, 𝔊 Ιεεθ, 𝔊L Ιααθ. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.10\">1 Ch 23:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.11\">11</a>, 𝔊 Ιεθ, 𝔊L Ιειηλ. <strong>c.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.22\">1 Ch 24:22</a>, 𝔊 Ιναθ, 𝔊L Ιααθ. <strong>d.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.12\">2 Ch 34:12</a>, 𝔊 Ιε(θ), 𝔊L Ιαεθ.","next":"BDB, מַ֫חַת","prev":"BDB, חָתָה"}